@brief The `gh_mlb41` greenhouse - the reference site every example here is drawn
       from.

`gh_mlb41` is the reference @ref setup "site": a complete, working implementation of
one physical greenhouse and its PLC program. `libbotanik` stays generic; this site
is the single source of truth for that one greenhouse, and the concrete thing the
simulator animates and the OPTA firmware flashes. When the guides say "the site",
this is what they mean - copy it to start a new deployment.

- @subpage md_src_2sites_2gh__mlb41_2README - the site directory: its files, the
  payload, the firmware subclass, the alarm table, and the mock PLC.
